        "caption": {
            "has_translation": null,
            "created_at": 1701092705,
            "pk": "17987189990310477",
            "text": "🌟 We are excited to announce that Astana Hub is hosting a webinar in collaboration with Microsoft on Microsoft for Startups Founders Hub and Microsoft Azure OpenAI. \n\n🚀 This is a great opportunity for aspiring and established entrepreneurs to learn from the experts and get insights on how to leverage these powerful tools for their businesses.\n\n🗣 The webinar will feature Adrian Gheorghe, Partner Development Manager Central Europe and Central Asia at Microsoft for Startups Founders Hub and Levon Hovhannisyan, Sr. Partner Technology Strategist CEE at Microsoft Azure OpenAI. \n\nThe speakers will share their experience on how to join and benefit from this exclusive program that provides access to technical and business resources, mentorship, and funding opportunities for startups and demonstrate how to use Azure OpenAI, a cloud-based service that enables developers to build and deploy artificial intelligence applications that can understand natural language, generate text , analyze images, and more.\n\n🔥 Don't miss this chance to learn from the best and network with other like-minded entrepreneurs!\n\n❗️ Register to the webinar by the link in the profile description."
